    <text>
        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1457_5221.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Unßer</unclear> fründtlich und nachpurlich willig dienst
<lb n="2"/>sambt was wir ehren liebs und guots <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermoe</unclear>-
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuovor</unclear>. Frommen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürnemen</unclear>, ersamen
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besonder</unclear> lieben fründt und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guott</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbaren</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wyr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habend</unclear> uß üwerem fründt- und
<lb n="6"/>nachparlichem schryben, (deßen wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zum</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoechsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">danckbar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbyettend</unclear>) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sovyl</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wol</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernomen</unclear>, wellicher maaßen nicht
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">by</unclear> üch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonder</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> in der statt <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-24" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Lind-
<lb n="10"/>ow</placeName> etliche unghorsamische lünwat beschauwt.
<lb n="11"/>worden. Und sintenmal dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aber</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>diß jars, ab <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßeren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">blaichinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vyl</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lün</unclear>-
<lb n="13"/>wat entpfrembdt worden. Sendennd
<lb n="14"/>wir zaigern diß zue üch, wie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> mit
<lb n="15"/>ainem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schryben</unclear>, an <orgName resp="#ner">herren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schultheißen</unclear>
<lb n="16"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">radte</unclear> der statt Baden</orgName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgeuertiget</unclear>,
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oblicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derghoersamische</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lünwat</unclear> ob die den
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßeren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entpfrembdt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moechte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">edwuhin</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besichtigend</unclear>. Deßwegen gelangt an üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßer</unclear>
<lb n="20"/>fründt- und nachparlich pitt, Ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellind</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zaigern</unclear> diß, solliche lünwat besichtigen. Und
<lb n="22"/>da sy den unßerigen zuoghorig, daß sy zun unßer
<lb n="23"/>handen uns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuokomen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, da wellend dann
<lb n="24"/>wir verschaffen, das dieselbige <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jhenigen</unclear>
<lb n="25"/>so sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">luth</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschwornen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urkundts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">endt</unclear>-
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wehrt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehendiget</unclear> werde. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Deßglichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> (nach
<lb n="27"/>üwerem fründtlichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erpieten</unclear>, der Lindischen
<lb n="28"/>lünwat wegen) ouch alle mügliche anlaitt-
<lb n="29"/>ung geben, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darinn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">also</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotwillig</unclear> erzaigen, als unßere sondere
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1457_5222.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="31"/>guet verthrauwentz ußsendt, des begeren In
<lb n="32"/>derglychen und andern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begebenhaiden</unclear>, wir
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachparlich</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gantz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachparlich</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">onuerbergt</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zebeschulden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeuerdienen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sambtlich</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schirm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gottes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beuelhende</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dat</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><origDate when="1604-06-22" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">22ten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tag</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Junij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ao</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etc</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">1604</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="37"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermaister</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Raath</unclear>
<lb n="38"/>der statt Sainct Gallen</orgName>
<lb n="39"/>An <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-517" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Schullthais und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Raath</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Statt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wyl</unclear></orgName>.
<lb n="40"/>Unser fründtlich willig dienst, und was wir
<lb n="41"/>ehren liebs und guets vermoegend zueuor
<lb n="42"/>fromm fürsichtig Eersam, wyß, besonders
<lb n="43"/>lieb und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guete</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Alßdann</unclear> wir glaub-
<lb n="44"/>hafft bericht, wie das Ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">argwoehnige</unclear>
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Linwat</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">behändt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ze</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüweren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ober</unclear>-
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kaitlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">handen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebracht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wann</unclear> dann
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßersoehn</unclear>, das nicht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nuer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear>
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vergangnen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sunder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jars</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßern</unclear>
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Blaichimeistern</unclear> vil linwat entwendet
<lb n="50"/>worden. Deßwegen ist <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derselben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßern</unclear>
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Blaichimeistern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">throngenliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear>
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zezaigern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abzuuermügen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lin</unclear>-
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wat</unclear> wegen alle gepürende nachforschúng
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1457_5223.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="54"/>zehaben. Gelangt deßwegen an uech unser
<lb n="55"/>fruendtlich pitt, Ir wellend <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ime</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">disem</unclear>
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Teuetschwander</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Cuonrat</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herschinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußgeschriben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erhebtes</unclear>
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">holzhaut</unclear>. und da er durch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glaublich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waar</unclear>-
<lb n="58"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erkuende</unclear>, das die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">under</unclear> inen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sigen</unclear>,
<lb n="59"/>sonder. Alßdann Ime disem Cuonrat vermoeg
<lb n="60"/>daßselb schwebster eidgnoßischer verkomnuß,
<lb n="61"/>zuostellen laßen. So wellen wir die zuo unsern
<lb n="62"/>handen nemen, und volgends demshenigen
<lb n="63"/>dem sy von pillicheit wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ghoerdt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wider</unclear>-
<lb n="64"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear> laßen. und alß sich hierinnen
<lb n="65"/>so guotw guezigen, wellchen gegen inen alß zuo
<lb n="66"/>uch vnser mit woluerthraewten fand. So
<lb n="67"/>begeeren umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uech</unclear>, wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derglichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">un</unclear>
<lb n="68"/>andern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fellen</unclear>, wir ganz geneigt und guot,
<lb n="69"/>willig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerumb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zebeschtulden</unclear>. Mit hilff
<lb n="70"/>deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Allerhechsten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">In</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welliches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heilliger</unclear>
<lb n="71"/>schirm wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uech</unclear> und uns trewlichen thund.
<lb n="72"/>Datum den <origDate when="1604" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">22isten</unclear> Junij Ao 1604</origDate>.
<lb n="73"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und Raath
<lb n="74"/>der stadt Sanct Gallen</orgName>.
<lb n="75"/>An <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner">Schultheiß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">un</unclear> Raath d statt Baden</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1457_5224.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="76"/><origDate when="1604-06-22" resp="#ner">22. junii 1604</origDate>. An <origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</origPlace>.
<lb n="77"/>Wegen deß abfuehrens Bleichinen, und roeuwen
<lb n="78"/>leiniwath.
</p>
